values ('bbbb0005-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a', 'en', null, 'Ancient Egypt: History & Civilization', 'Walk the Nile from the first pharaohs to Cleopatra and discover how a desert river built one of the longest-lived civilizations in human history, across geography, religion, writing, and empire. The course keeps to accurate dynasty and era framing with BCE dates throughout. Structure and facts adapted from the article ''Ancient Egypt'' on Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia (CC BY-SA 4.0).', null, 'foundations', 50, true, 'humanities', '{}')
on conflict (id) do nothing;

